Krypton: Hand native requests back to the user during an agent task.

Stop agent-originated file pickers, downloads, payment sheets, passkey
requests and external-protocol launches before the native flow starts.
The agent task pauses and the user may perform the step directly.

--- a/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc
@@ -23,6 +23,9 @@
